				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t05r0201_oldwoman1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どにちに　なるとな
[Name:Item Idx="0" ]を　あつめている▽
ひとが　やってきてな▽
べつの　どうぐと　とりかえてくれるぞ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T07:45:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>土日に　なるとな
[Name:Item Idx="0" ]を　集めている▽
人が　やってきてな▽
別の　道具と　取替えてくれるぞ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T07:46:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
